        "created_at": "2012-11-07T05:21:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I donno about that. We played with Hakka tonight and watched him do 40+ damage to Akashbuta. In one hit. Savage mana is nasty. Course that is a special case. (And I as Unity then dropped 20ish damage on her? :P Poor tempest didn't do more than 11 :P)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But even without that special case, Hakka still can drop 10 or 11 damage pretty easily, and thats no small power.&nbsp;</p>",
